# slug: ch71-decode
# source: chapters/ch71.tex:85
# label: alg:ch71-decode
# pseudocode source: chapters/ch71.tex:88
# caption: Decode a bounded byte record without native-structure casts.

REQUIRE packet with known byte extent N; payload limit L
ENSURE tag and payload, or rejection without an out-of-bounds read
IF N<5 THEN
  reject short header
END IF
read tag byte; decode four-byte little-endian length n
IF n>L or n != N-5 THEN
  reject inconsistent extent
END IF
return tag and the payload bytes in [5,N)

